# Google Maps API Configuration
# Get your API key from: https://console.cloud.google.com/google/maps-apis/
# Make sure to enable the following APIs:
# - Maps JavaScript API
# - Places API (if needed)
# - Geocoding API (if needed)

REACT_APP_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=YOUR_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY_HERE

# Note: Replace YOUR_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY_HERE with your actual Google Maps API key
# For development purposes, you can use a restricted key
# For production, make sure to set up proper API key restrictions
